{"findings":[{"rule_id":"WPS-004","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D12","page":1,"quote":"⌀ 16 H7 (+0.018/0)"},{"kind":"title_block","ref":"surface_treatment","page":1,"quote":"I.Z.B.P. (TRIVALENT)"}],"comment":"The ⌀16 H7 bore carries a tight ISO fit tolerance but the part is zinc plated; plating buildup will reduce the hole diameter and may prevent the mating shaft from fitting. The designer should either increase the bore size to allow for coating thickness or add a note requiring masking of the bore during plating."

,
"recommended_correction":"Add a note specifying that the ⌀16 H7 bore must be masked during I.Z.B.P. plating, or adjust the nominal/tolerance to account for the expected plating thickness."}]}
